hing from distance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zPSQQxkJWEsPjM42x8vzulzU7lQ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13498","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100432","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"36510","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"82737","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"351049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"7543","synopsis":"Maiden Volunteer Corps heads to the battleground, Orléans! \"What can a child do?\" Even though Alençon looked down on her at first, he couldn't hide his surprise after seeing Jeanne's superhuman battle. However, England's Duke of Bedford releases two ultimate warriors into the battlefield to get rid of Jeanne. Their names are Ulysses Hunter Glasdale, and Ulysses Noir! A shocking ending following the clash between superhuman powers...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tzfuvvIQ3OUDYvt0b7662C7agk5.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Maiden Volunteer Corps heads to the battleground, Orléans! \"What can a child do?\" Even though Alençon looked down on her at first, he couldn't hide his surprise after seeing Jeanne's superhuman battle. However, England's Duke of Bedford releases two ultimate warriors into the battlefield to get rid of Jeanne. Their names are Ulysses Hunter Glasdale, and Ulysses Noir! A shocking ending following the clash between superhuman powers...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tzfuvvIQ3OUDYvt0b7662C7agk5.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13498","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"100432","episode